{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/9ec9e73dd514bf512cce6955446fc4b7.poster.avif?t=1754646502\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/9ec9e73dd514bf512cce6955446fc4b7.webm?t=1754646502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/9ec9e73dd514bf512cce6955446fc4b7.mp4?t=1754646502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mythmatch has all the joy of a merge game without any ads or microtransactions. Instead, we have a variety of gameplay and an anti-capitalist story about standing up against the gods of Olympus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Family to Un-Find</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5acc9b2ce5b9264e9c854390e28faf1a.poster.avif?t=1754646502\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5acc9b2ce5b9264e9c854390e28faf1a.webm?t=1754646502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5acc9b2ce5b9264e9c854390e28faf1a.mp4?t=1754646502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Artemis was born to be a Goddess, but even amongst immortals, the gatekeeping runs deep. Use the spite to fuel you and show them what you're made of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Help the Mortals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/aadb36396e32f8c7b79317a62ec33f02.poster.avif?t=1754646502\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/aadb36396e32f8c7b79317a62ec33f02.webm?t=1754646502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/aadb36396e32f8c7b79317a62ec33f02.mp4?t=1754646502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thrown down from Olympus, work with the mortals to\u00a0resources, craft materials, and build a new Ithaca that works for them. Gain Belief, power up, and take the fight back to Olympus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenge the Gods</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/a7ee2bb5f2931edafafd62f6672570d8.poster.avif?t=1754646502\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/a7ee2bb5f2931edafafd62f6672570d8.webm?t=1754646502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/a7ee2bb5f2931edafafd62f6672570d8.mp4?t=1754646502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While you\u2019re fixing up the mortal realm, you\u2019ll be tearing things down in Olympus. Prove your worth as you face the challenges from the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win, and you could earn their favour. Can you convince them to show grace to the mortals? Or are you all better off without them?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1778050?t=1754646502","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/621a726a06a3ab65faedc5cbce6e52d7d3dece42/